<Behavior #aiagent-tasktree-tools apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #tasktreewrite (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8G>
      系统 MUST 使用 `TaskTreeWrite` 作为任务树状态更新入口，支持 `replace_root`、`expand`、`update_status` 三类操作。
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8G>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "tasktreewrite" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #replace-root { name = "使用 replace_root 初始化任务树" } [
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8H>
              任务树根节点子任务被替换为输入任务集合
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8H>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8J>
              返回可读的任务树渲染结果
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8J>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8K>
              当前会话存在 AIAgent actor
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8K>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8M>
              调用 `TaskTreeWrite` 且 `op=replace_root`
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8M>
            )>
            <Case #in-progress-expand { name = "仅允许 in_progress 任务执行 expand" } (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8N>
              某任务状态不是 `in_progress`
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8N>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8P>
              调用 `TaskTreeWrite` 且 `op=expand`
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8P>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8Q>
              系统拒绝扩展并返回可识别错误
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8Q>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #tasktreeread-json (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8R>
      系统 MUST 提供 `TaskTreeRead` 工具，并返回完整 `TaskTree` JSON（包含 `root` 与 `nextId`）。
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8R>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "tasktreeread-json" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #case-3 { name = "读取完整结构" } [
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8S>
              返回值包含完整 JSON 结构
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8S>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8T>
              返回内容包含 `root` 字段与 `nextId` 字段
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8T>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8V>
              会话内已存在任务树状态
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8V>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8W>
              调用 `TaskTreeRead`
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8W>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #runsubagent (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8X>
      系统 MUST 以 `RunSubAgent` 作为子代理调用工具名，旧名 `RunSubTask` 不再作为标准入口。
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8X>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "runsubagent" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #case-4 { name = "使用新工具名调用子代理" } [
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8Y>
              系统按输入参数创建子代理任务
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8Y>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8Z>
              工具调用链路不依赖 `RunSubTask` 名称
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ8Z>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ90>
              已注册可用 agent_type
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ90>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ91>
              调用 `RunSubAgent`
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ91>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #tooldefinitions-schema (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ92>
      系统 MUST 在 `ToolDefinitions` 中基于 builtin tool defs 组装 schema，避免重复手写 schema 定义导致漂移。
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ92>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "tooldefinitions-schema" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #case-5 { name = "组装工具清单时不依赖重复硬编码" } [
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ93>
              使用工具目录 schema 作为来源
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ93>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ94>
              不再维护重复的同名手写 schema
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ94>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ95>
              已存在工具目录下的 ToolDef schema
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ95>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ96>
              构建 base tools 与动态工具描述
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ96>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #requirement-5 (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ97>
      terminal 侧 SHALL 只完成 minimal 运行与基础映射对齐，不要求完整 TUI 深度体验优化。
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ97>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "requirement-5" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #minimal { name = "minimal 提示词与工具名一致" } (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ98>
              启动 terminal minimal
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ98>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ99>
              查看系统提示词与工具映射
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ99>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9A>
              使用 `TaskTreeWrite`、`TaskTreeRead`、`RunSubAgent` 新命名
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9A>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #requirement-6 (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9B>
      本能力规范 SHALL 仅描述已完成改动，不额外扩展新特性。
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9B>
      <Suites [
        <Suite { name = "requirement-6" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #case-7 { name = "规范收敛为已落地行为" } [
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9C>
              内容聚焦于现状行为与契约
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9C>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9D>
              不新增与目标无关功能
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9D>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9E>
              代码已存在相关实现
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9E>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9F>
              审查该能力规范
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9F>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
    <Requirement #task-space-authority-migration (
      <Statement ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9G>
      General TaskTree tools SHALL remain a planning surface, while organization execution SHALL be owned only by canonical TaskSpace; no TaskTree activeForm, status or Holon projection SHALL trigger, mirror or recover autonomous execution.
      </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9G>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #task-authority-separation { name = "TaskTree and TaskSpace authority separation" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #general-tasktree-remains-local (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9H>
              A user uses TaskTreeRead or TaskTreeWrite without an AI workflow.
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9H>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9J>
              The tree contains pending or in-progress planning nodes.
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9J>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9K>
              The nodes SHALL remain ordinary planning facts and SHALL NOT be claimed or dispatched by a Holon runtime.
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9K>
            )>
            <Case #organization-task-is-taskspace-only (
              <Given ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9M>
              A canonical Holon task changes lifecycle state.
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9M>
              <When ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9N>
              Product tools or recovery observe the change.
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9N>
              <Then ?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9P>
              Only TaskSpace receipts SHALL represent the transition; TaskTree and VM Holon fields SHALL receive no dual write or executable compatibility projection.
              </?01M1A0QMAMTA3CZ32BMFKNPZ9P>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
